  "details": "Having a large number of total friends causes nearly all main menu functions, starting with the social section, to run slowly.\n\nThis issue began around December, and while I initially thought it might be a beta version bug, it appears to occur even in recent release versions.\n\nI waited for several updates afterward, but since it doesn't seem to be fixed, I am reporting it.\n\nThis state significantly hinders gameplay, so please address it promptly.",
